ouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T15:50:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T15:50:59Z","body":"I want to minimize the width as much as possible, so I prefer #103042 since it reduces the width more effectively and I don't see issue with removing the renderer change option from there. However, if removing it is a deal breaker, then this alternative seems like a good compromise.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160709227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160792013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109357#issuecomment-3160792013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109357","id":3160792013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68ZdvN","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T16:17:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T16:33:35Z","body":"> I want to minimize the width as much as possible, so I prefer #103042 since it reduces the width more effectively and I don't see issue with removing the renderer change option from there. However, if removing it is a deal breaker, then this alternative seems like a good compromise.\r\n\r\n* Another fix similar to this one https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97878 will help reducing the size of the top panel if we apply it to the main screen editor plugin buttons.\r\n\r\nlike this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bb7467d-c663-4bff-8b85-b1c539284118\r\n\r\n* Also I was thinking about applying a fix for the `MenuBar` inspired from VSCode:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae1dea96-72cb-46ea-8726-ca5f3ccb2f16\r\n\r\nIt should be discussed with the Godot devs first to see which fix is better to be implemented, the first one is ready and the second one will require much work and discussions to find the best way to implement it without breaking compatibility or causing regressions, also if we apply the second option it will reproduce the issue when having many main screen editor plugins.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160792013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161086172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109357#issuecomment-3161086172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109357","id":3161086172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68aljc","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T18:03:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T18:03:53Z","body":"While I like the idea of using icons here, when only the icon is visible, they don't feel very visually distinct from each other. Like, if I was looking at only one of the icons at a time, I personally would have trouble remembering which renderer it represents.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161086172/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161098256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109357#issuecomment-3161098256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109357","id":3161098256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68aogQ","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T18:08:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T18:22:02Z","body":"> While I like the idea of using icons here, when only the icon is visible, they don't feel very visually distinct from each other. Like, if I was looking at only one of the icons at a time, I personally would have trouble remembering which renderer it represents.\r\n\r\nThere are 3 different colors used for Renderers, Green for `Forward+`, Pink for `Mobile` and blue for `Compatibility`, but I'd agree with any better icon ideas to make them more unique.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"132\" alt=\"Screenshot From 2025-08-06 21-09-20\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3252002-49ec-4aae-b32d-b7925285e9ba\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161098256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3161449051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109357#issuecomment-3161449051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109357","id":3161449051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68b-Jb","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T20:11:07Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T20:11:07Z","body":"Perhaps Forward+ could be depicted by a \"modern\" computer monitor, Mobile a phone (as it does now), and Compatibility an older-looking monitor?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/